    "html": "\n<p><strong>Last updated: 2 November 2026.</strong></p>\n<p>Bhilai, the steel town in Chhattisgarh's Durg district, has three national coaching brands with JEE classroom batches confirmed on their own official pages: Aakash Institute and ALLEN Career Institute, both near GE Road in Supela, and PW Vidyapeeth in Nehru Nagar (West). This guide lists only what we could confirm, and says what we could not.</p>\n\n<div class=\"tldr-box\"><p class=\"tldr-label\">Quick facts</p>\n<p><strong>City:</strong> Bhilai, Durg district, Chhattisgarh</p>\n<p><strong>Exam covered:</strong> JEE Main and JEE Advanced (2027 cycle)</p>\n<p><strong>Institutes listed:</strong> 3, each confirmed on its own official website as of 2 November 2026</p>\n<p><strong>Coaching areas:</strong> GE Road (Supela) and Nehru Nagar (West)</p>\n<p><strong>Next JEE date:</strong> JEE Main 2027 Session 1 on 20 to 24 and 28 January 2027; registration closes 22 November 2026 (<a href=\"https://jeemain.nta.nic.in/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">NTA</a>)</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2>How we picked this list</h2>\n<p>We included an institute only if its own website shows a JEE programme at a centre in Bhilai. Directory sites name more institutes, but without an official page or recent confirmation we did not rank them. We kept the list to three instead of padding it to ten. If you run or know an institute that should be here, send us its official page and we will check it.</p>\n\n<h3>1. Aakash Institute, GE Road</h3>\n<p>Aakash's <a href=\"https://www.aakash.ac.in/bhilai-city\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Bhilai page</a> gives the address as PN 2, 3rd Floor, Supela Chauhan Estate, GE Road, Bhilai 490023, and lists JEE (Main), JEE (Main and Advanced), NEET-UG and Class 7 to 10 foundation courses. The page says Bhilai students show strong results but gives no figures, and it lists fee components without amounts. Aakash's separate centre-locator page shows a Katulbod address for Bhilai, so confirm the exact branch before you visit.</p>\n\n<h3>2. ALLEN Career Institute, Supela</h3>\n<p>ALLEN's <a href=\"https://www.allen.ac.in/admission/bhilai/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Bhilai admission page</a> gives the address as 1st to 3rd Floor, Chouhan State Phase-2, behind Life Care Diagnostic Centre, Chandra Mourya Chowk, GE Road, Supela, and lists JEE (Main + Advanced), NEET-UG and foundation courses. Its <a href=\"https://allen.in/bhilai/jee-main-advanced\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">JEE page for Bhilai</a> names a 2-year Nurture programme for students moving from Class 10 to 11 and a 1-year Enthusiast programme for students moving from Class 11 to 12. The pages say ALLEN has a proven JEE record but give no figures or fees for this centre.</p>\n\n<h3>3. PW Vidyapeeth, Nehru Nagar (West)</h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://www.pw.live/offline-centres/batches/vidyapeeth/bhilai-ct/bhilai-vidyapeeth-587253\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">PW Vidyapeeth Bhilai page</a> lists the centre at Block No. 2, Plot No. 5, Nehru Nagar (West), next to Pulse Hospital. JEE batches are a 2-year Class 11 programme, a 1-year Class 12 programme and a 1-year dropper batch. No fee amounts are published; the page says the PWSAT scholarship test can earn up to 90 percent off tuition. The page carries student testimonials rather than centre-wide results, and we could not verify them.</p>\n\n<h2>What we left out, and why</h2>\n<p>Vedantu's offline-centre page does not list Bhilai, so we did not include it. Older directory pages mention FIITJEE and other names in Bhilai, but we found no current official page confirming a JEE batch for them, so they are not listed.</p>\n\n<h2>How to choose</h2>\n<p>Aakash and ALLEN are on the same stretch of GE Road, so location will not separate them; batch size, faculty and the test series will. PW Vidyapeeth suits students who want a Class 11, Class 12 and dropper structure with the option of a scholarship test. Sit in a demo class at each, ask for results from this centre and not from the brand nationally, and get fees in writing, since none of the three publishes them.</p>\n<p>JEE Main 2027 registration closes on 22 November 2026, so settle your form first. See every verified listing in the city on our <a href=\"coaching-bhilai.html\">Bhilai coaching page</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Last updated: 2 November 2026.</strong></p>\n"
